  /// AccountSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  /// beside: "Address", "Password", "Passkeys"
  description "A code from an app on your phone after your password, so a stolen password is not enough." => "En kod från en app i din telefon efter lösenordet, så att ett stulet lösenord inte räcker.";
  /// AccountSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  description "Another account that signs you in here." => "Ett annat konto som loggar in dig här.";
  /// AccountSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  /// beside: "Address", "Passkeys", "Two-step sign-in"
  description "What you sign in with, after your address." => "Det du loggar in med, efter din adress.";
  /// AccountSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  /// beside: "Password", "Passkeys", "Two-step sign-in"
  description "Where your mail goes, and how you sign in." => "Dit din e-post går och hur du loggar in.";
  /// AccountSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  description "With its country code. A text proves it is yours." => "Med landskod. Ett sms bevisar att det är ditt.";
  /// AccountSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  /// beside: "Address", "Password", "Two-step sign-in"
  description "Your phone, your laptop or a security key signs you in — no password, no code." => "Din telefon, din dator eller en säkerhetsnyckel loggar in dig: inget lösenord, ingen kod.";
  /// AccountSettings · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  hint "So you can tell your passkeys apart. Your device asks you to confirm next." => "Så att du kan hålla isär dina nycklar. Din enhet ber dig bekräfta härnäst.";
  /// AccountSettings · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  /// beside: "Current password"
  hint "Type it last, so it is fresh. A recovery code works as well." => "Skriv den sist, så att den är färsk. En reservkod fungerar också.";
  /// AccountSettings · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  hint "We mail it a link; your account moves to it when the link is opened." => "Vi mejlar en länk dit; ditt konto flyttas dit när länken öppnas.";
  /// AccountSettings · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  hint "With its country code. We text it a code to confirm it is yours." => "Med landsnummer. Vi sms:ar en kod till det för att bekräfta att det är ditt.";
  /// AccountSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~26 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "Current password"
